    <div id="center" class="wideRight">
                    <h1>Advanced Higher Economics</h1>
                <p>The Advanced Higher Economics course gives learners a wide range of contexts that enable them to analyse, interpret, predict and explain the economic actions of consumers, businesses, governments and other organisations. Learners extend their knowledge and understanding of current issues in the Scottish, UK and global economies, and gain an in-depth understanding of how markets are structured and why they can fail.</p>

        
                
                
                
        
    </div>
